For our client located in WESTENDE, we are looking for a WHEELED EXCAVATOR OPERATOR.

Our client is a well-established contractor carrying out projects for both the public and private sectors.

Do you enjoy working outdoors and getting your hands dirty? Then we would be happy to help you find your next challenge!

As a WHEELED EXCAVATOR OPERATOR in WESTENDE, your responsibilities will include:

• Operating a wheeled excavator for earthmoving and infrastructure projects;
• Carrying out excavation works according to plans and instructions;
• Excavating trenches, construction pits and foundations;
• Performing earthmoving activities and assisting with levelling and grading of terrain.
As a WHEELED EXCAVATOR OPERATOR in WESTENDE, you can identify yourself with the following requirements:

• You speak Dutch or English;
• You have extensive experience as a WHEELED EXCAVATOR OPERATOR;
• You are hands-on and enjoy working outdoors;
• Motivation is what we need!

