For our client located in WESTENDE, we are looking for aTRUCK DRIVER C.

Our client is a well-established contractor carrying out projects for both the public and private sectors.

As a TRUCK DRIVER C in WESTENDE, your responsibilities will include:

• Transporting materials by truck to various construction sites across East and West Flanders;
• Delivering materials, tools and occasionally smaller machines to different sites in the region;
• Carrying out tipper and container transport, mainly involving waste and construction materials;
• Loading and unloading materials and equipment ready for transport;
• Assisting with various tasks on-site and being willing to lend a helping hand whenever needed.


As a TRUCK DRIVER in WESTENDE, you can identify yourself with the following requirements:

• You hold a valid Category C driving licence;
• You have a valid Code 95 and driver qualification card;
• Early starts and long working days are no problem for you (between 5:00 AM and 6:00 PM);
• You have a good command of Dutch or English;
• You work accurately and always prioritise safety.

